  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Mississippi Half Step Uptown Toodeloo** (1 review): Crowd roared at the start and middle of this song, apparently when Jerry images first appeared on the screens [3]\n- **Drums** (1 review): Reviewer played drums into space on a home theater and felt the bass pulse [4]\n- **St. Stephen** (1 review): Band stumbled slightly coming out of the jam, though the reviewer calls it a difficult song [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Touchdown: Music Never Stopped**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [7]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Lift Off [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2024-05-16.Tire_Iron** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 195 min; rated 4/5 by 2 [1]\n- **deadco2024-05-16.tj**: source not stated; 19 songs; 193 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [2]. Said about its sound: Audio is imperfect, with audible crowd noise that becomes part of the listening experience, but far better than nothing; Uploader says the recording is not good and suggests it is for completists only, since better ones likely exist [2][3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Crowd 1st Set, Crowd 2nd Set [1]\n- Before that, Bobby appeared on screen in vignettes, enormously larger than life, before the crowd erupted [6]\n- First night of the band's final residency at the Sphere; uploader met Andrew from Channel 5 in the Arts District [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2024-05-16.Tire_Iron**: taped by Eric Lugassy; transferred by Eric Lugassy; source: B9 C31F > Schoeps Active Cables > Baby Nbox > Roland R-07 [1]. Also: Lineage runs SD card to WAV, Reaper, then 24-bit FLAC, transferred by the taper himself [1]\n- **deadco2024-05-16.tj**: taped by thomascirca; transferred by thomascirca; source: Schoeps MK4s > Babynbox > PCM-A10 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Honateez: [Dead And Company Show Sphere Las Vegas May 2024 Fan Gifts Home Decor Poster Canvas - Honateez](https://honateez.com/product/dead-and-company-show-sphere-las-vegas-may-2024-fan-gifts-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [8]",
